{"3962020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EXD - Extra Dimensional", "steam_appid": 3962020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/542b423bfcd33492e1577cf687531541.poster.avif?t=1781690248\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/542b423bfcd33492e1577cf687531541.webm?t=1781690248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EXPECTED HERO. A WORLD BEYOND IMAGINATION.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Max Ventura</strong>, an ordinary delivery guy working for Megazon. When a dimensional rift tears through your warehouse, everything changes. You are pulled into <strong>Erath</strong>, a fantasy world tainted by ancient relics from Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the <strong>Quantum Glove</strong> and the powers granted by the <strong>Dimensional Guardians</strong>, you must journey across a realm of dragons, mutant creatures, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover lost Earth artifacts, grow stronger, survive deadly traps, and uncover the truth about the <strong>First Chosen, </strong>a mysterious figure who failed the same mission long before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS THAT FEEL REAL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/87c95df1d11c94df1ee035d3a614523e.poster.avif?t=1781690248\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/87c95df1d11c94df1ee035d3a614523e.webm?t=1781690248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>EXD</strong>, your hands are your greatest weapon.<br>Every object reacts with astonishing realism: feel the weight of the weapons you wield, the texture of every surface you touch, and the precision of full physical interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Quantum Glove</strong> grants you telekinetic power. Summon <strong>fireballs</strong> between your palms, hurl <strong>ice spikes</strong>, and unleash devastating <strong>lightning bolts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll feel the energy vibrate through your fingertips.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER POWERFUL WEAPONS. FACE YOUR ENEMIES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Erath</strong> is filled with secrets. Survive traps, solve puzzles, and discover legendary weapons and artifacts, the <strong>Minar Alloy Blades</strong>, the <strong>Wands</strong>, and the <strong>Timelox</strong>, capable of slowing time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your glove’s energy runs low, these relics become your lifeline against fully physical enemies.<br>Undead hordes, mutant insects, Dragonids, and powerful wizards serving the Emperor will stop at nothing to keep you from cleansing Erath of Earth’s corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every forgotten corner... and uncover treasures powerful enough to change your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FEAST FOR THE SENSES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXD</strong> brings the world of Erath to life with breathtaking visual fidelity, inspired by classic fantasy artists <strong>Frank Frazetta</strong> and <strong>Boris Vallejo</strong>.<br>Explore vast crystal caverns, witness stunning landscapes, and descend into ancient underground temples that will leave you speechless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>orchestral soundtrack</strong> evolves dynamically with your actions, sweeping melodies for exploration, intense arrangements for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>3D spatial audio</strong>, you’ll hear the wind howl through the canyons, the roar of a creature behind stone walls, and the crackle of lightning surrounding you.<br>A world so vivid, you’ll forget the danger lurking behind its beauty.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/542b423bfcd33492e1577cf687531541.poster.avif?t=1781690248\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/542b423bfcd33492e1577cf687531541.webm?t=1781690248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN EXPECTED HERO. A WORLD BEYOND IMAGINATION.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Max Ventura</strong>, an ordinary delivery guy working for Megazon. When a dimensional rift tears through your warehouse, everything changes. You are pulled into <strong>Erath</strong>, a fantasy world tainted by ancient relics from Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with the <strong>Quantum Glove</strong> and the powers granted by the <strong>Dimensional Guardians</strong>, you must journey across a realm of dragons, mutant creatures, and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover lost Earth artifacts, grow stronger, survive deadly traps, and uncover the truth about the <strong>First Chosen, </strong>a mysterious figure who failed the same mission long before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS THAT FEEL REAL.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962020/extras/87c95df1d11c94df1ee035d3a614523e.poster.avif?t=1781690248\" width=620 height=348 >